      "content": "idk. \"fighting\" just feels like a way to describe a slow death. i spend 12 hours a day seeing the absolute worst parts of being human, and for what? to keep the machine running for another day so it can just break again? it feels like i'm just participating in a tragedy that never ends. there's no winning here. there's just... the exhaustion.",
